WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.890
Coordinator (American female): Good afternoon, Riverside Arts Centre. How can I help?

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:12.030
Caller (British male): Hello. I'd like to book an evening course. I saw the leaflet last week, but I wanted to check a few details before paying.

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:18.235
Coordinator (American female): No problem. We can go through it together. Are you looking for an adult class or a course for a child?

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:25.771
Caller (British male): An adult class, please. I'm hoping to do something practical after work, rather than another online course.

00:00:26.351 --> 00:00:30.313
Coordinator (American female): All right. Can I take your surname so I can open a booking record?

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:34.534
Caller (British male): Patel. P, A, T, E, L.

00:00:35.014 --> 00:00:40.205
Coordinator (American female): Thank you. Patel, P-A-T-E-L. I've got that. Which course interests you?

00:00:40.655 --> 00:00:48.345
Caller (British male): I first considered photography, but I'd prefer pottery. My friend did the photography class last year and recommended the centre.

00:00:48.925 --> 00:00:59.060
Coordinator (American female): Pottery is quite popular this term. The course starts on the sixth of November, not the fourth as shown in the old leaflet. That earlier date was changed when the tutor became unavailable.

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:03.066
Caller (British male): The sixth works for me. How many sessions are there?

00:01:03.516 --> 00:01:12.882
Coordinator (American female): There are six Wednesday evening sessions. The first one is an introduction to the equipment, and by the final week students usually make a small set of bowls.

00:01:13.602 --> 00:01:19.116
Caller (British male): That sounds good. I haven't used a wheel before, so I may need a little help at the beginning.

00:01:19.696 --> 00:01:27.044
Coordinator (American female): That's perfectly normal. The tutor demonstrates each stage, and there are only ten people in the group, so everyone gets a turn.

00:01:27.624 --> 00:01:37.342
Coordinator (American female): The full fee is eighty-five pounds. The ninety-five-pound figure includes an optional exhibition ticket, so you don't need to choose that unless you want to attend the end-of-term show.

00:01:38.062 --> 00:01:40.783
Caller (British male): I see. What is included in the course fee?

00:01:41.233 --> 00:01:56.513
Coordinator (American female): All basic materials are included, and students may use the evening studio without extra charge. Tools can be hired if you want to take extra work home, refreshments are sold downstairs, and parking costs four pounds after five o'clock.

00:01:57.233 --> 00:02:03.215
Caller (British male): I'll probably come by bus, but it is useful to know about the parking. How will I receive the timetable?

00:02:03.665 --> 00:02:12.294
Coordinator (American female): We'll email it this afternoon. It includes the room number and a list of materials. Your membership card must be collected at reception before your first class.

00:02:13.014 --> 00:02:17.138
Caller (British male): Right. I'll look out for the email. What time does the class begin?

00:02:17.588 --> 00:02:28.417
Coordinator (American female): At six thirty. The building opens at six and the tutor arrives at six fifteen, so you can come early to find your locker. The session normally finishes at eight thirty, with a short break in the middle.

00:02:29.137 --> 00:02:33.055
Caller (British male): Perfect. Do I need to bring an apron or anything on the first evening?

00:02:33.505 --> 00:02:41.687
Coordinator (American female): An old shirt is useful, although we provide protective aprons. Please bring your membership card and arrive ten minutes early to sign the safety form.

00:02:42.407 --> 00:02:51.010
Caller (British male): That's clear. I chose this centre because the classes are small, so I should receive more feedback. The timetable also fits around my work.

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:58.252
Coordinator (American female): That makes sense. I'll reserve your place now and email the confirmation, timetable and payment receipt later today.

00:02:58.832 --> 00:03:00.680
Caller (British male): Thanks very much for your help.

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:04.536
Coordinator (American female): You're welcome. We look forward to seeing you in November.
